ription": "Students examine revival as a mass religious phenomenon."}, {"id": "7c270291-67e9-4dd6-acf3-7b744ba34063", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Modern missions and reform", "children": [{"id": "090590f8-87e6-4116-833d-85fc26d883e4", "type": "concept", "title": "William Carey"}, {"id": "be70e648-cd31-4fe6-8c32-c8d592a9d6c2", "type": "concept", "title": "Missionary societies"}, {"id": "1ae3c9f5-f061-4737-bf83-54ea93881183", "type": "concept", "title": "Bible societies"}, {"id": "227e03aa-369f-4c0d-98df-66c4da2ce728", "type": "concept", "title": "Abolition"}, {"id": "d959f83a-a5da-4220-831e-58528dcdc56c", "type": "concept", "title": "Temperance"}, {"id": "7fdb4702-bb53-48fb-a865-bda3863834b7", "type": "concept", "title": "Social reform"}, {"id": "1d1639aa-732c-412c-ba9e-e92a2608e30c", "type": "concept", "title": "Indigenous evangelists"}, {"id": "f3d49660-7ea6-448b-8ffe-87e5ebae2c0c", "type": "concept", "title": "Mission schools"}], "description": "The point is to connect mission with education, medicine, translation, abolition, empire, and critique."}]}, {"id": "e19e7ed8-e5fb-471d-bba2-f5cf53456a45", "type": "topic", "title": "Pentecostal and Charismatic Movements", "description": "Pentecostal and charismatic Christianity is one of the most important global Christian developments of the twentieth and twenty-first centuries. Students learn its origins, practices, networks, and social impact.", "children": [{"id": "35516c38-0c3c-43b4-b0a8-98cbd5b88c1f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Origins and early movements", "children": [{"id": "c2798e87-9871-413b-a048-fe7fc7c38489", "type": "concept", "title": "Azusa Street"}, {"id": "04927700-3d62-4acc-9bcd-e0b83188a42e", "type": "concept", "title": "William Seymour"}, {"id": "16bb38ed-175d-4f02-963d-6f34fbae36e8", "type": "concept", "title": "Charles Parham"}, {"id": "b28ed59e-3bf8-4567-a784-a23f33ea20ec", "type": "concept", "title": "Holiness movement"}, {"id": "78f49f96-e43a-4aef-ad80-000f49b5c4bd", "type": "concept", "titl